+# USDC Staking
+
+Minimal USDC staking dApp. Deposit USDC, withdraw the full position anytime. No rewards.
+
+## Contracts (`packages/hardhat`)
+
+- `Staker.sol` — holds each user's USDC deposit; `stake(amount)` / `withdraw()`. Uses OZ `SafeERC20` + `ReentrancyGuard`, checks-effects-interactions. Token address is set at deploy.
+- `MockUSDC.sol` — local-only test token faithful to real USDC (name "USD Coin", symbol "USDC", 6 decimals). Open `mint` for the local faucet — do not deploy to a live network.
+- `deploy/01_deploy_staker.ts` — on `base` points the Staker at native USDC (`0x8335…2913`); elsewhere deploys `MockUSDC` (as name "USDC") and uses that.
+
+## Frontend (`packages/nextjs`)
+
+- `/stake` page: stake, withdraw, and view wallet USDC, ETH (gas), and staked position — all with USD context.
+- `contracts/externalContracts.ts` — native USDC on Base (8453).
+- `contracts/deployedContracts.ts` — local (31337) USDC + Staker, matching a fresh `yarn deploy` (overwritten on deploy).
+
+## Local dev
+
+```bash
+yarn install
+yarn chain            # terminal 1
+yarn deploy           # terminal 2 — deploys MockUSDC + Staker
+yarn start            # terminal 3 — http://localhost:3000/stake
+```
+
+Mint local test USDC via the Debug Contracts page (`USDC.mint`).
+
+## Go live on Base
+
+1. `yarn deploy --network base` — deploys Staker against native USDC; regenerates `deployedContracts.ts` with the Base Staker.
+2. In `scaffold.config.ts`, make `chains.base` the first entry of `targetNetworks` (it drives the generated contract types and the default network).
+3. Set a production RPC (`NEXT_PUBLIC_ALCHEMY_API_KEY`) and `NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID`.
